{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Möbius 反演"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Möbius反演"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Möbius 反演说的是对于数论函数 $f,g\\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to\\mathbb{C}$,\n若 $f = g * 1$, 则 $g = f * \\mu$, 其中 $\\mu$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Möbius函数","text":"Möbius 函数"}},{"Plain":", 运算 $*$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Dirichlet卷积","text":"Dirichlet 卷积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>推广: 范畴上的 Möbius 反演</h2>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴代数","text":"范畴代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}